À%␀␀␀À/À/!À8␀␀␀ÀVÀVÀ\␀ÀCÀKÀLÀdÀjÀkÀ{,À{,„ÖÀ~îƒ”/// Attempt to make (a portion of) this or a descendant [RenderObject] visible
/// on screen.
///
/// If `descendant` is provided, that [RenderObject] is made visible. If
